# Auto-Agent Autonomous Scheduling Examples
#
# To use: crontab -e
# Then copy the desired lines below
#
# IMPORTANT: Replace /path/to/auto-agent with your actual path
# Example: /Users/outsmart104/Documents/Projects/Personal/auto-agent

# ============================================
# CONSERVATIVE SETUP (Recommended for Start)
# ============================================

# Daily morning briefing at 9 AM
0 9 * * * /path/to/auto-agent/scripts/daily_agent.sh

# Weekly asset check every Monday at 10 AM
0 10 * * 1 /path/to/auto-agent/scripts/asset_generator_agent.sh check


# ============================================
# MODERATE SETUP
# ============================================

# Daily morning briefing at 9 AM
0 9 * * * /path/to/auto-agent/scripts/daily_agent.sh

# General autonomous run 3x daily (9 AM, 1 PM, 6 PM)
0 9,13,18 * * * /path/to/auto-agent/scripts/autonomous_run.sh

# Asset check every Monday at 10 AM
0 10 * * 1 /path/to/auto-agent/scripts/asset_generator_agent.sh check

# Asset optimization every Friday at 5 PM
0 17 * * 5 /path/to/auto-agent/scripts/asset_generator_agent.sh optimize


# ============================================
# AGGRESSIVE SETUP (High Activity)
# ============================================

# Morning briefing at 8 AM
0 8 * * * /path/to/auto-agent/scripts/daily_agent.sh

# General autonomous run every 4 hours (8 AM, 12 PM, 4 PM, 8 PM)
0 8,12,16,20 * * * /path/to/auto-agent/scripts/autonomous_run.sh

# Asset check every Monday and Thursday at 9 AM
0 9 * * 1,4 /path/to/auto-agent/scripts/asset_generator_agent.sh check

# Asset optimization every Friday at 4 PM
0 16 * * 5 /path/to/auto-agent/scripts/asset_generator_agent.sh optimize

# Asset generation every other Wednesday (1st and 3rd) at 10 AM
0 10 1-7,15-21 * 3 /path/to/auto-agent/scripts/asset_generator_agent.sh generate


# ============================================
# CUSTOM SCHEDULES
# ============================================

# Run every 6 hours
0 */6 * * * /path/to/auto-agent/scripts/autonomous_run.sh

# Run every hour during work hours (9 AM - 5 PM, Mon-Fri)
0 9-17 * * 1-5 /path/to/auto-agent/scripts/autonomous_run.sh

# Run every 30 minutes during peak hours
*/30 9-17 * * * /path/to/auto-agent/scripts/autonomous_run.sh

# Weekend asset generation (Saturday 10 AM)
0 10 * * 6 /path/to/auto-agent/scripts/asset_generator_agent.sh generate


# ============================================
# CRON SYNTAX REFERENCE
# ============================================
#
# * * * * *
# │ │ │ │ │
# │ │ │ │ └─ Day of week (0-7, 0 or 7 = Sunday)
# │ │ │ └─── Month (1-12)
# │ │ └───── Day of month (1-31)
# │ └─────── Hour (0-23)
# └───────── Minute (0-59)
#
# Special characters:
# *  = Any value
# ,  = List (e.g., 1,3,5)
# -  = Range (e.g., 1-5)
# /  = Step (e.g., */2 = every 2)
#
# Examples:
# 0 9 * * *       = Every day at 9:00 AM
# 0 */6 * * *     = Every 6 hours
# 0 9 * * 1       = Every Monday at 9:00 AM
# 0 9 1 * *       = 1st of every month at 9:00 AM
# */15 * * * *    = Every 15 minutes
# 0 9-17 * * 1-5  = Every hour 9 AM-5 PM, Mon-Fri


# ============================================
# ENVIRONMENT VARIABLES
# ============================================
#
# Set API key for content generation
# Add this at the TOP of your crontab:
ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=sk-ant-api03-your-key-here

# Set PATH if needed
PATH=/usr/local/bin:/usr/bin:/bin

# Set shell (recommended)
SHELL=/bin/bash


# ============================================
# COST ESTIMATES (Claude Sonnet 4.5)
# ============================================
#
# Conservative: ~$6/month
# Moderate: ~$37/month
# Aggressive: ~$150-300/month
#
# Start conservative, scale based on value generated!
